    link https://github.com/dagornc/swarmdrones-likec4/blob/master/specification/Spec_ALG_FORMATION_CONTROL_v1.pdf "Specification detaillee Controle de formation v1 (PDF) — depot PRIVE dagornc/swarmdrones-likec4 (specification/)"
    link https://github.com/dagornc/swarmdrones-likec4/blob/master/sysml/ALG_FORMATION_CONTROL.sysml "Specification SysML v2 (ALG_FORMATION_CONTROL.sysml) — relation documentedBy portee par sysml.c4"
    description 'Document de specification detaillee de l algorithme ALG_FORMATION_CONTROL (Controle de formation), version v1, dans le depot PRIVE dagornc/swarmdrones-likec4 (specification/). Validation : PUBLIEE — conforme (SPEC-13-PUBLISH, t_79a5637b). La specification SysML v2 associee vit dans sysml/ALG_FORMATION_CONTROL.sysml et est referencee par l element specDoc sysml* de sysml.c4 (relation documentedBy deja presente — non dupliquee ici).'
    metadata {
